{"pageid":5239,"title":"Refined Jukebox Jr.","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Refined Jukebox Jr.</span>","revid":22083,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The Refined Jukebox Jr. holds 4 different music discs, being able to also skip a disc to others and so on, making it easier to make multiple music and better logic of it. 0 power - pauses disc, 1 power - skip record, 5 power - play record, and 10 power - eject the record. It can only be interacted with automatically with interactor, but only ejecting the record. Manual is a better option.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902191431\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.001 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.001 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:5239-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902191431 and revision id 22083. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[],"images":[]}
